  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Carlsmed’s AI‑enabled spine implants are gaining rapid adoption, with a fast‑growing surgeon user base and rising procedure volumes. Peer‑reviewed data showing a 74% reduction in revision rates versus traditional devices provides a strong clinical differentiator, potentially accelerating market conversion. Recent product debuts broaden the portfolio, deepening its foothold in the personalized spine surgery space.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Management raised full‑year guidance on the back of strong quarterly momentum, signaling confidence in the commercial ramp. The company is investing aggressively in R&D and sales infrastructure to scale, while maintaining a solid cash position. Peer‑reviewed publications and new product introductions underscore a commitment to evidence‑based innovation. The focus remains on driving better patient outcomes and cost efficiency, which supports the long‑term adoption narrative despite ongoing investment‑mode losses.",
